@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le -> 201 Created + Header Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200402",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200402-bit/V-Duy-Linh-dtc245200402"
}

### 4. Doc lai luot nop vua tao -> 200 OK (bam lai sau 1s, 3s de xem processing -> graded)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Thieu studentCode hoac repositoryUrl -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200402",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200402-bit/V-Duy-Linh-dtc245200402"
}

### 7. Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Negotiate dung duong dan -> 200 OK
POST {{api}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Negotiate sai duong dan (thieu chu s) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{api}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
